    "transcript": [
      {
        "speaker": "S1",
        "text": "Good morning, everyone. I have some important news about next week's school trip to the science museum. We are going on Thursday, not Wednesday, because the museum is closed on Wednesdays. The bus will leave from the school gate at eight forty-five, so please be there at eight thirty. The journey takes about an hour. At the museum, there are two parts. In the morning, you will see the space exhibition and watch a short film about the planets. After that, you will have lunch in the museum café. Please bring a packed lunch if you do not want to buy food, because the café is quite expensive. In the afternoon, we will do a workshop where you build a small rocket. Each group has four students, and I will tell you your group on Monday. Remember to wear comfortable shoes, because we will walk a lot. You must not bring your mobile phones into the workshop. Finally, the trip costs twelve pounds, which you should give to your form teacher by Friday. If you have any problems, please talk to me after class."
      }
    ]
